WEBVTT

00:02:58.966 --> 00:03:02.011
I took the plunge,
and I gave up meat completely.

00:03:02.637 --> 00:03:06.432
It took another 12 years for me
to give up eggs and dairy.

00:03:06.474 --> 00:03:11.312
And now between the veganism
and the foraging,

00:03:11.354 --> 00:03:17.360
I have one of the more
eclectic pantries in the world.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.196
(Video) Meet the Indigo Milk Cap.

00:03:20.196 --> 00:03:22.531
Let's make a fancy dessert out of seaweed.

00:03:22.573 --> 00:03:24.325
Here is a mimosa tree.

00:03:24.367 --> 00:03:26.661
Please be a puffball!
Please be a puffball!

00:03:26.702 --> 00:03:28.204
(Laughter)

00:03:28.246 --> 00:03:29.747
It was a puffball.